    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We at Felicity Fox are delighted to present to the market this superbly located mid terrace one bedroom cottage on a quiet residential street in the heart of The Liberties.  There is a small yard to the rear and on street resident permit car parking to the front.  This house presents a great opportunity to create a wonderful home in a much sought after location.  Viewing is a must!\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises entrance hallway leading to the kitchen/living room.  A bathroom is situated off a lobby.  The bedroom is to the rear of the house.  There is a south east facing yard to the rear.  \r\n\r\nMeath Place is a quiet residential street located in the heart of The Liberties.  The area has a strong community at its centre and is steeped in local history.  Dublin 8 is a part of the city where old meets new and it has previously been voted one of the world's coolest places to live.  The highly convenient location is within walking distance of Christchurch, Temple Bar and Grafton Street.  The area is a food lovers delight with great coffee shops, a choice of restaurants and an eclectic range of food stores.  Social amenities include Vicar Street and other late night venues.  The historic attractions available in the vicinity are the Guinness Storehouse, Christchurch Cathedral and Dublin Castle. The area is well served by Dublin Bus."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall     3.25m x 1.57m\r\n\r\nKitchen/living room     3.31m x 2.98m plus 2.60m x 1.55m\r\nFireplace. Fitted units.\r\n\r\nLobby     1.72m x 0.86\r\nDoor to rear garden.\r\n\r\nBathroom     1.93m x 1.70m\r\nBath. WC. Wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom     2.37m x 2.27m\r\nBuilt-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nYard     3.05m x 2.20m\r\nSouth east facing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "1 Bedroom mid terrace house\r\nVacant for more than 2 years\r\nFloor area approximately 38sqm/408sqft\r\nSouth east facing yard to rear\r\nOn street resident permit parking\r\nWithin walking distance of Christchurch, Temple Bar and Grafton Street\r\nServed by numerous bus routes\r\nShort walk to LUAS red line"
      },
